## 🧭 Start Here <a id="start-here"></a>

<details open>
<summary><b>💼 Recruiter &amp; Hiring Manager</b> (TL;DR, key highlights, availability)</summary>

<br>

{% if has(profile.links.resume_pdf) %}
- **Resume:** [Download Resume (PDF)]({{ profile.links.resume_pdf }})
{% endif %}
{% if has(profile.identity.availability.text) %}
- **Availability:** {{ profile.identity.availability.text }}
{% endif %}
{% if has(profile.identity.availability.work_mode) %}
- **Work Mode:** {{ profile.identity.availability.work_mode }}
{% endif %}
{% if has(profile.identity.roles_targeted) %}
- **Roles Targeted:** {{ profile.identity.roles_targeted | join(" • ") }}
{% endif %}

{% set featured_projects = [] %}
{% for p in profile.projects if p.featured %}
  {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
    {% set _ = featured_projects.append(p) %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if has(featured_projects) %}
**Top Featured Projects:**
{% for p in featured_projects %}

- **{{ p.title }}**: {{ p.tagline }}{% if has(p.links.live) %} ([Live Demo]({{ p.links.live }})){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% set recruiter_contacts = [] %}
{% if has(profile.links.email) %}
  {% set _ = recruiter_contacts.append("[" ~ (profile.links.email | replace('mailto:', '')) ~ "](" ~ profile.links.email ~ ")") %}
{% endif %}
{% if has(profile.links.linkedin) %}
  {% set _ = recruiter_contacts.append("[LinkedIn Profile](" ~ profile.links.linkedin ~ ")") %}
{% endif %}
{% if has(recruiter_contacts) %}
**Direct Contact:** {{ recruiter_contacts | join(" &nbsp;•&nbsp; ") }}
{% endif %}

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🛠️ Software Engineer &amp; Tech Lead</b> (Architecture, codebases, stack)</summary>

<br>

{% if has(profile.projects) %}
**Key Projects &amp; Architectures:**
{% for p in profile.projects %}
{% if loop.index <= 4 %}

- **{{ p.title }}** (`{{ p.status.value }}`): {{ p.tagline }}
  {% if has(p.stack) %}
  - **Stack:** {{ p.stack | join(", ") }}
  {% endif %}
  {% if has(p.highlights) %}
  - **Architecture:** {{ p.highlights[0] }}
  {% endif %}
  {% if has(p.repo) %}
  - **Repository:** [github.com/{{ p.repo }}](https://github.com/{{ p.repo }})
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

</details>

{% if has(profile.publications) or has(profile.open_source.interests) %}
<details>
<summary><b>🔬 Researcher &amp; Academic</b> (Publications &amp; research interests)</summary>

<br>

{% if has(profile.open_source.interests) %}
**Research Interests:**
{% for interest in profile.open_source.interests %}
- {{ interest }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if has(profile.publications) %}
**Publications:**
{% for pub in profile.publications %}
- **{{ pub.title }}** ({{ pub.year }}) - {{ pub.venue }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

</details>
{% endif %}
